# Sephiroth, Fabled SOLDIER: "Whenever another creature dies, target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life. If this is
# the fourth time this ability has resolved this turn, transform Sephiroth." Bot1 casts Sephiroth on turn 1 (Mox Jet, Ruby and
# Pearl); nothing else is in play, so his enters ability asks nothing. Bot2 makes three Ornithopters on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1
# makes one and casts Pyroclasm: four creatures die at once, so the ability triggers four times and resolves four times: the
# fourth transforms him (CR 608.2m, 701.27), and "as this creature transforms" he gets the emblem (CR 712.20): 20 - 4 = 16 for
# Bot2, 20 + 4 = 24 for Bot1. Two more Ornithopters enter, and Sephiroth, One-Winged Angel (5/5 flier) attacks: he sacrifices
# both ("any number", draw that many: two Islands), and the emblem drains for each death, as Sephiroth's own front-face ability
# is gone: 14 and 26, then his 5 damage: Bot2 ends at 9.

